---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { site } from "../data/site";
---

<Base title="Privacy" description="Privacy policy for stavros-giannis.de">
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p>This is a private, non-commercial website. It uses no cookies, no analytics, no tracking and no third-party content.</p>

    <h2>Controller</h2>
    <p>{site.name}, {site.location}. Email: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a></p>

    <h2>Server logs</h2>
    <p>
      When you visit this site, the web server processes your IP address, the requested page, date and time,
      referrer and browser user agent. This is needed to deliver the site and keep it secure
      (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR). Logs are not combined with other data and are deleted after a short period.
    </p>

    <h2>Email</h2>
    <p>If you email me, I use your address and message only to reply (Art. 6(1)(b) and (f) GDPR).</p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      You have the right to access, rectification, erasure, restriction of processing, objection and data
      portability, and the right to lodge a complaint with a supervisory authority, for example the
      Landesbeauftragte für Datenschutz und Informationsfreiheit Nordrhein-Westfalen.
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>
